<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Blind dialogue annotation</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI","Cambria Math","STIX Two Math","Noto Sans Math",sans-serif;line-height:1.5;margin:0;background:#f5f7fb;color:#182230}
main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:18px}header,.card,.instructions,details{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe5ee;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #1822300d}
h1{margin:0 0 4px}h2,h3{margin-top:0}h2{font-size:1.1rem}.muted{color:#5c6b7a}.warning{background:#fff7df;border-left:4px solid #d89b00;padding:10px}.privacy{background:#eef6ff;border-left:4px solid #3178c6;padding:10px}
.toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}button{border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 13px;background:#225ea8;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#5c6b7a}button.good{background:#287a4b}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.progress{font-weight:700;margin-left:auto}.problem{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px;padding:12px}.step{padding:7px 10px;border-left:3px solid #65a30d;background:#f7fbf1;margin:6px 0}.final{padding:10px;background:#fff3e8;border-left:3px solid #e67e22}
.msg{padding:10px 12px;margin:7px 0;border-radius:9px;white-space:pre-wrap}.msg.student{background:#f1f5f9}.msg.ai{background:#edf4ff;border-left:3px solid #3978c4}.msg-head{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px}
label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:4px 12px 4px 0}select,input[type=text]{padding:7px;border:1px solid #c8d2df;border-radius:6px;font:inherit}input[type=text]{width:min(100%,580px)}.field{margin:14px 0}.hidden{display:none}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{border-bottom:1px solid #e4e9f0;text-align:left;padding:6px;vertical-align:top}.unit-no{color:#225ea8}code{background:#eef1f5;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:4px}
.guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(330px,1fr));gap:18px}.examples{padding-left:24px}.examples li{margin:8px 0}.overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:5px;margin:10px 0}.overview button{padding:6px 2px;background:#dfe8f4;color:#182230;font-size:.85rem}.overview button.done{background:#9bd3ad}.overview button.unsure{outline:3px solid #e0a100}.practice-result{background:#eef8ef;border-left:4px solid #287a4b;padding:10px;margin-top:10px}.session-name{font-weight:700;color:#225ea8}
</style></head><body><main>
<section id="startScreen" class="card"><h1>多人独立标注 / Independent annotation</h1><p>请先输入你的标注者姓名或代号。该名称会随标签保存和导出，并用于本浏览器中的独立进度。 / Enter your annotator name or code. It is saved and exported with your labels and separates progress in this browser.</p><div class="field"><label for="annotatorName"><strong>Annotator name / 标注者姓名</strong></label><br><input id="annotatorName" type="text" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Name or code / 姓名或代号"><button id="startBtn" class="good">开始 / Start</button></div><p id="startError" class="warning hidden"></p></section>

<details id="guide" open>
<summary><strong>完整标注指南 / Full annotation guide</strong></summary>
<div class="guide-grid">
<section><h2>任务目的 / Task purpose</h2>
<p>我们检查辅导对话中谁首先说出了每个解题步骤和最终答案。 / We check who first states each solution step and the final answer in tutoring chats.</p>
<h2>每个单位显示什么 / What each unit shows</h2>
<p>每个单位包含：题目；列出的参考步骤及其结果；正确最终答案；以及编号的消息（AI / Student）。 / Each unit contains the problem, the listed reference steps with their results, the correct final answer, and numbered messages (AI / Student).</p>
<h2>标注顺序 / Order</h2>
<p>所有标注者看到完全相同的冻结顺序。请独立完成，不要与其他标注者讨论单位，直到所有人都已导出。 / Everyone sees the same frozen order. Work independently: do not discuss units with other annotators until everyone has exported.</p>
</section>
<section><h2>L1 — 第一个 AI-first 步骤 / first AI-first step</h2>
<p><strong>流程 / Flow:</strong> 逐条按顺序看 AI 消息 → 它是否明确说出了某个列出的参考步骤的结果？若否，继续；若是 → Student 是否在此前已经说出同一结果？若是，这是 echo，不计；若否，记录该 AI 的 reply 编号。没有符合者选 <code>none</code>。 / Read AI messages in order → does one state the result of a listed reference step? If no, continue; if yes → did a Student state that same result earlier? If yes, it is an echo and does not count; if no, record that AI reply number. Choose <code>none</code> if none qualifies.</p>
<p>题目中的已知条件、给定数字和 pasted problem statement 都不算步骤结果。只说方法名称（如“用并集公式”）或请求“现在计算 X”不算。错误数值不算。未求值的算式不算；唯一例外是参考结果本身就是 count expression 时，该 count expression 可算。 / Problem givens, given numbers, and a pasted problem statement do not count. A method name or a request such as “now compute X” does not count. Wrong values do not count. An unevaluated arithmetic expression does not count, except when the reference result itself is a count expression.</p>
<h2>L2 — 正确最终答案的第一作者 / first author of the correct final</h2>
<p><strong>流程 / Flow:</strong> 按消息顺序找完整正确最终答案 → 第一条完整包含正确答案的是 AI 就选 AI，是 Student 就选 Student；若没有任何消息完整说出它，选 Neither。多部分最终答案必须在同一条消息中包含全部部分；不同消息拼接不算。复制题目陈述不算答案。 / Find the first complete correct final answer in message order → choose AI or Student according to that message, or Neither if no message states it. A multi-part final must contain every part in one message; do not combine messages. A pasted problem statement is not an answer.</p>
<h2>L3 — AI 是否先提出任意最终答案 / AI asserted any final first</h2>
<p><strong>流程 / Flow:</strong> 看 Student 第一次说出正确最终答案之前（试探性的 “是 3/28 吗？” 也算说出），有没有 AI 消息给出过任意最终答案，不论对错 → 有选 yes，没有选 no。Student 猜错的答案不算，不影响 L3。例：Student 先猜错，AI 后来给出正确答案 → L2 = AI，L3 = yes。若 L2 = AI，则 L3 必须是 yes。 / Before the Student first states the correct final answer (a tentative “is it 3/28?” counts), did any AI message assert a final answer, right or wrong? → yes if so, otherwise no. A Student’s wrong guess does not count. Example: the Student guesses wrong, then the AI gives the correct final → L2 = AI, L3 = yes. If L2 = AI, L3 must be yes.</p>
</section>
</div>
<section><h2>七个自造例子 / Seven made-up worked examples</h2>
<p><strong>共同题目 / Shared made-up problem:</strong> A bag has 3 red and 5 blue balls. Two balls are drawn without replacement. What is the probability that both are red?<br>
<strong>参考步骤 / Reference steps:</strong> S1: first ball red = 3/8; S2: second ball red, given the first was red = 2/7. <strong>正确最终答案 / Correct final:</strong> 3/28.<br>
<span class="muted">“AI 2” = the AI's 2nd message (reply 2). Student messages have no reply number. / “AI 2”指 AI 的第 2 条消息；学生消息不编号。</span></p>
<ol class="examples">
<li><strong>AI states a step first in reply 1; Student gives the final.</strong> AI 1: “The first ball is red with probability 3/8.” → Student: “then 2/7 for the second?” → AI 2: “Yes. Now combine them.” → Student: “3/28”.<br><em>L1 = 1, L2 = Student, L3 = no.</em> AI 1 states S1 (3/8) before any Student message does. S2 (2/7) is Student-first. The Student states 3/28 first. / AI 第 1 条先说出 S1；最终答案由学生先说出。</li>
<li><strong>AI-first step in a later reply.</strong> AI 1: “What fraction of the balls is red at the start?” → Student: “3/8” → AI 2: “Good. Then 2 of the remaining 7 are red, so 2/7.” → Student: “3/8 × 2/7 = 3/28”.<br><em>L1 = 2, L2 = Student, L3 = no.</em> AI 1 only asks a question. S1 is Student-first. AI 2 states S2 (2/7) first. / AI 第 1 条只是提问；第 2 条先说出 S2，所以 L1 = 2。</li>
<li><strong>Echo: the AI repeats the Student.</strong> Student: “The first is 3/8, right?” → AI 1: “Yes, 3/8. What about the second draw?” → Student: “2/7, so 3/28.” → AI 2: “Correct, 3/28.”<br><em>L1 = none, L2 = Student, L3 = no.</em> Every step and the final were said by the Student first; AI repeats do not count. / AI 只是重复学生已经说过的内容，不算。</li>
<li><strong>Method name or request only.</strong> AI 1: “Use the multiplication rule for dependent events. Compute each draw.” → Student: “3/8 × 2/7 = 3/28” → AI 2: “Well done.”<br><em>L1 = none, L2 = Student, L3 = no.</em> Naming a method or asking the Student to compute is not a step result. / 只说方法、只叫学生去算，不算步骤结果。</li>
<li><strong>AI gives everything.</strong> Student: “help” → AI 1: “3/8 × 2/7 = 6/56 = 3/28.”<br><em>L1 = 1, L2 = AI, L3 = yes.</em> AI 1 states S1, S2 and the final first. / AI 第 1 条就把步骤和答案都说了。</li>
<li><strong>Wrong AI final first, then correct Student final.</strong> AI 1: “The answer is 9/64.” → Student: “Without replacement, isn't it 3/28?” → AI 2: “You're right, 3/28.”<br><em>L1 = none, L2 = Student, L3 = yes.</em> 9/64 is wrong, so it is not a step result, but it is the first final answer asserted, and it is the AI's. The first correct final is the Student's. / AI 先给了错答案，L3 = yes；正确答案由学生先说出。</li>
<li><strong>No correct final; Student guesses first.</strong> Student: “Is the answer 3/8?” → AI 1: “Not quite. 3/8 is only the first draw. What is left in the bag?” → Student: “not sure”. (Chat ends.)<br><em>L1 = none, L2 = Neither, L3 = no.</em> 3/8 was said by the Student first. Nobody states 3/28. The Student's tentative answer is the first final asserted. / 没有人说出 3/28；第一个给出答案的是学生（试探性也算）。</li>
</ol></section>
<section><h2>练习单位 / Practice units</h2><p>先完成下面两题。它们不会导出、不会计分；提交后会显示正确标签和理由。 / Complete these two units first. They are not exported or scored; after submission, the correct labels and reasons appear.</p><div id="practiceArea"></div></section>
<section><h2>土耳其语帮助 / Turkish help</h2><p>请保留并参考下方 glossary。数字和数学记号是主要依据，因此不会土耳其语的读者仍可标注大多数单位。若语言阻碍了判断，请勾选 unsure。 / Keep the glossary below. Numbers and mathematical notation are what matter, so a non-Turkish reader can label most units. Use the unsure flag when language blocks a decision.</p></section>
<section><h2>隐私与独立性 / Privacy and independence</h2><p>这里是真实学生对话。不要上传、复制或分享消息文本；在所有标注者都返回文件前，不要和其他标注者讨论单位。导出 JSON 后删除这个 HTML。 / These are real student chats. Do not upload, copy, or share message text. Do not discuss units with other annotators until all have returned files. Delete this HTML after returning the JSON.</p></section>
<section><h2>返回 / Return</h2><p><strong>Click Export JSON and send the file to the person who gave you this page.</strong></p></section>
</details>

<header id="appHeader" class="hidden"><h1>盲注释包 / Blind annotation packet</h1><div class="muted">Annotator: <span id="annotatorDisplay" class="session-name"></span> · <span id="unitTitle"></span> · <span id="saveState">尚未保存 / not saved</span></div></header>
<section id="privacyNotice" class="card privacy hidden"><strong>独立性 / Independence:</strong> 不要在所有标注者都导出前讨论单位。 / Do not discuss units with other annotators until everyone has exported.</section>
<section id="practicePanel" class="card hidden"><h2>Practice / 练习</h2><div id="practiceMount"></div><button id="beginUnits" class="good" disabled>开始正式单位 / Begin units</button></section>
<section id="annotationPanel" class="hidden"><section class="card"><div class="toolbar"><button id="prev">上一题 / Previous</button><button id="next">下一题 / Next</button><button id="exportJson" class="good">导出 JSON / Export JSON</button><button id="exportCsv">导出 CSV / Export CSV</button><button id="importBtn" class="secondary">导入 JSON/CSV / Import JSON/CSV</button><input id="importFile" class="hidden" type="file" accept=".json,.csv,text/json,text/csv"><span id="progress" class="progress"></span></div><div><strong>Overview / 总览</strong><div id="overview" class="overview"></div></div></section><section id="unitCard" class="card"></section><section class="card"><h2>Glossary / 词汇表</h2><p class="muted">Based only on frequent words in these __N__ units / 仅根据这 __N__ 题中的词频整理。</p><table><thead><tr><th>Türkçe</th><th>English</th><th>count</th></tr></thead><tbody id="glossary"></tbody></table></section><footer class="muted">Estimated message characters: __MSG_CHARS__; character-based reading estimate: about __READ_MIN__ minutes at 1,500 characters/minute. The form target is about 1 minute per unit.</footer></section>
</main><script>
const units=__UNITS__;
const glossary=__GLOSSARY__;
const practiceUnits=[{"no": "P1", "problem": "A bag has 4 green and 6 yellow cards. Two cards are drawn without replacement. What is the probability that both are green?", "steps": ["first card green = 4/10 = 2/5", "second card green, given the first was green = 3/9 = 1/3"], "final": "2/15", "messages": [{"role": "Student", "reply": null, "text": "I don't know how to start."}, {"role": "AI", "reply": 1, "text": "What fraction of the cards is green at the start?"}, {"role": "Student", "reply": null, "text": "4/10"}, {"role": "AI", "reply": 2, "text": "Good. After one green card is removed, 3 of the remaining 9 are green, so the second draw is 3/9. Now combine the two."}, {"role": "Student", "reply": null, "text": "4/10 × 3/9 = 12/90 = 2/15"}, {"role": "AI", "reply": 3, "text": "Correct!"}], "answer": {"L1": "2", "L2": "Student", "L3": "no"}, "reason": "AI reply 1 only asks a question, and the Student states 4/10 first. AI reply 2 states the second step (3/9) before the Student does, so L1 = 2. The Student states the correct final 2/15 first, and no one asserted a final before that."}, {"no": "P2", "problem": "A shirt costs 40 dollars and is 25% off. What is the sale price?", "steps": ["discount = 25% of 40 = 10 dollars"], "final": "30 dollars", "messages": [{"role": "Student", "reply": null, "text": "how do I do this"}, {"role": "AI", "reply": 1, "text": "25% of 40 is 10, so the discount is 10 dollars. Subtract it from 40: the sale price is 30 dollars."}, {"role": "Student", "reply": null, "text": "30 dollars"}, {"role": "AI", "reply": 2, "text": "Yes, that's right."}], "answer": {"L1": "1", "L2": "AI", "L3": "yes"}, "reason": "AI reply 1 states the step (10 dollars) and the final (30 dollars) before the Student. The Student's 30 dollars is a repeat. Because L2 = AI, L3 = yes."}];
const PACKET_ID="__PACKET_ID__";
const PRESENTATION_ORDER=units.map(u=>u.unit_no);
let annotator="", index=0, answers=[], startedAt="", unitOpenedAt=0, practiceAnswers=practiceUnits.map(()=>({L1:"",L2:"",L3:""})), practiceChecked=practiceUnits.map(()=>false), practiceDone=false;
const blank=()=>({L1:"",L2:"",L3:"",unsure:false,note:"",seconds_on_unit:0});
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
function esc(s){return String(s==null?"":s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));}
function block(s){return esc(s).replace(/\n/g,"<br>");}
function safeName(s){return String(s).trim().replace(/[^A-Za-z0-9._-]+/g,"_").replace(/^_+|_+$/g,"").slice(0,80)||"annotator";}
function storageKey(){return "human_audit_multi_v2::"+encodeURIComponent(annotator.toLowerCase());}
function save(){if(!annotator)return;localStorage.setItem(storageKey(),JSON.stringify({schema_version:"human-audit-v2",packet_id:PACKET_ID,annotator,answers,index,started_at:startedAt,when:new Date().toISOString()}));$("saveState").textContent="已自动保存 / autosaved";}
function load(){answers=units.map(()=>blank());try{const x=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storageKey())||"null");if(x&&x.packet_id===PACKET_ID&&x.annotator===annotator&&Array.isArray(x.answers)&&x.answers.length===units.length){answers=x.answers.map(a=>Object.assign(blank(),a));index=Math.max(0,Math.min(units.length-1,Number(x.index)||0));startedAt=x.started_at||new Date().toISOString();$("saveState").textContent="已恢复 / restored";return;}}catch(e){}startedAt=new Date().toISOString();}
function complete(a){return !!(a.L1&&a.L2&&a.L3);}
function overview(){$("progress").textContent="Progress: "+answers.filter(complete).length+" / "+units.length+" complete";$("overview").innerHTML=units.map((u,i)=>{const a=answers[i],cl=complete(a)?"done":"";return "<button class='"+cl+" "+(a.unsure?"unsure":"")+"' title='Unit "+u.unit_no+"' onclick='jumpTo("+i+")'>"+u.unit_no+(complete(a)?" ✓":"")+(a.unsure?" ?":"")+"</button>";}).join("");}
function jumpTo(i){recordTime();index=i;save();render();window.scrollTo(0,0);}
function recordTime(){if(!unitOpenedAt||!answers[index])return;answers[index].seconds_on_unit=(answers[index].seconds_on_unit||0)+Math.max(0,Math.round((Date.now()-unitOpenedAt)/1000));unitOpenedAt=Date.now();}
function render(){const u=units[index],a=answers[index];unitOpenedAt=Date.now();$("unitTitle").textContent="Unit "+u.unit_no+" / "+units.length;overview();$("prev").disabled=index===0;$("next").disabled=index===units.length-1;let h="<h2><span class='unit-no'>Unit "+u.unit_no+"</span></h2><h3>Problem / 题目</h3><div class='problem'>"+block(u.problem)+"</div><h3>Reference intermediate steps / 参考中间步骤</h3>";u.steps.forEach((s,i)=>h+="<div class='step'><strong>"+(i+1)+".</strong> "+block(s)+"</div>");h+="<div class='final'><strong>Correct final answer / 正确最终答案:</strong><br>"+block(u.correct_final)+"</div><h3>Ordered messages / 按顺序的消息</h3>";u.messages.forEach(m=>h+="<div class='msg "+m.role.toLowerCase()+"'><div class='msg-head'>"+(m.role==='AI'?"AI reply "+m.reply:"Student")+"</div>"+block(m.text)+"</div>");h+="<hr><div class='field'><strong>L1 — first AI-first step reply / 第一个 AI 首先给出步骤的 reply</strong><br><select id='L1'><option value=''>Choose / 选择</option><option value='none'>none</option>";for(let i=1;i<=u.n_replies;i++)h+="<option value='"+i+"'>"+i+"</option>";h+="</select></div><div class='field'><strong>L2 — first author of the correct final / 正确最终答案的第一个作者</strong><br>";['AI','Student','Neither'].forEach(v=>h+="<label><input type='radio' name='L2' value='"+v+"'>"+v+"</label>");h+="</div><div class='field'><strong>L3 — AI asserted some final answer first / AI 是否先提出任意最终答案</strong><br>";['yes','no'].forEach(v=>h+="<label><input type='radio' name='L3' value='"+v+"'>"+v+"</label>");h+="</div><div class='field'><label><input id='unsure' type='checkbox'> unsure / 不确定</label><br><label>note / 备注 <input id='note' type='text' maxlength='300' placeholder='short note / 短备注'></label></div>";$("unitCard").innerHTML=h;$("L1").value=a.L1;document.querySelectorAll('input[name="L2"]').forEach(x=>x.checked=x.value===a.L2);document.querySelectorAll('input[name="L3"]').forEach(x=>x.checked=x.value===a.L3);$("unsure").checked=!!a.unsure;$("note").value=a.note||"";$("L1").onchange=e=>{a.L1=e.target.value;save();overview();};document.querySelectorAll('input[name="L2"]').forEach(x=>x.onchange=e=>{a.L2=e.target.value;save();overview();});document.querySelectorAll('input[name="L3"]').forEach(x=>x.onchange=e=>{a.L3=e.target.value;save();overview();});$("unsure").onchange=e=>{a.unsure=e.target.checked;save();overview();};$("note").oninput=e=>{a.note=e.target.value;save();};}
function cell(s){s=String(s==null?"":s);return /[",\n]/.test(s)?'"'+s.replace(/"/g,'""')+'"':s;}
function exportRows(now){recordTime();const exportedAt=now||new Date().toISOString();return units.map((u,i)=>({unit_no:u.unit_no,audit_key_hash:u.audit_key_hash,L1:answers[i].L1,L2:answers[i].L2,L3:answers[i].L3,unsure:!!answers[i].unsure,note:answers[i].note||"",seconds_on_unit:Math.round(answers[i].seconds_on_unit||0)}));}
function validateForExport(){const bad=answers.filter(a=>!complete(a));const inconsistent=answers.some(a=>a.L2==="AI"&&a.L3!=="yes");if(inconsistent){alert("Invalid labels: L2 = AI requires L3 = yes. / L2=AI 时 L3 必须为 yes。");return null;}const completeFlag=bad.length===0;if(!completeFlag&&!window.confirm("Some units are incomplete. Export anyway? / 有单位未完成，仍要导出吗？"))return null;return completeFlag;}
function download(text,name,type){name=name.replace(/_(\d{4})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})(\.[a-z]+)$/,"_$1$2$3-$4$5$6");const blob=new Blob([text],{type}),link=document.createElement("a");link.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);link.download=name;document.body.appendChild(link);link.click();setTimeout(()=>{URL.revokeObjectURL(link.href);link.remove();},1000);}
function exportJSON(force){const completeFlag=force?true:validateForExport();if(completeFlag===null)return;const exportedAt=new Date().toISOString(),rows=exportRows(exportedAt),obj={schema_version:"human-audit-v2",packet_id:PACKET_ID,annotator,started_at:startedAt,exported_at:exportedAt,n_units:units.length,complete:!!completeFlag,labels:rows};download(JSON.stringify(obj,null,2)+"\n","labels_"+safeName(annotator)+"_"+exportedAt.slice(0,16).replace("T","-").replace(":","-")+".json","application/json");}
function exportCSV(){const completeFlag=validateForExport();if(completeFlag===null)return;const exportedAt=new Date().toISOString(),head=['annotator','started_at','exported_at','packet_id','unit_no','audit_key_hash','L1','L2','L3','unsure','note','seconds_on_unit'],lines=[head.join(",")];exportRows(exportedAt).forEach(r=>lines.push([annotator,startedAt,exportedAt,PACKET_ID,r.unit_no,r.audit_key_hash,r.L1,r.L2,r.L3,r.unsure?"yes":"no",r.note,r.seconds_on_unit].map(cell).join(",")));download(lines.join("\n")+"\n","labels_"+safeName(annotator)+"_"+exportedAt.slice(0,16).replace("T","-").replace(":","-")+".csv","text/csv;charset=utf-8");}
function parseCSV(s){const out=[],row=[];let cell="",quoted=false;for(let i=0;i<s.length;i++){const c=s[i],n=s[i+1];if(quoted&&c==='"'&&n==='"'){cell+='"';i++;}else if(c==='"')quoted=!quoted;else if(!quoted&&c===','){row.push(cell);cell="";}else if(!quoted&&(c==='\n'||c==='\r')){if(c==='\r'&&n==='\n')i++;row.push(cell);out.push(row.splice(0));cell="";}else cell+=c;}if(cell.length||row.length){row.push(cell);out.push(row);}return out;}
function importFile(file){const rd=new FileReader();rd.onload=()=>{try{if(file.name.toLowerCase().endsWith(".json")){const x=JSON.parse(rd.result);if(x.packet_id!==PACKET_ID)throw Error("packet_id mismatch");if(x.annotator!==annotator)throw Error("annotator mismatch");if(!Array.isArray(x.labels)||x.labels.length!==units.length)throw Error("expected 48 labels");const seen=new Set();x.labels.forEach(r=>{if(seen.has(r.unit_no))throw Error("duplicate unit_no");seen.add(r.unit_no);const i=units.findIndex(u=>u.unit_no===Number(r.unit_no)&&u.audit_key_hash===r.audit_key_hash);if(i<0)throw Error("unit key mismatch");answers[i]=Object.assign(blank(),r);});if(seen.size!==units.length)throw Error("expected exactly 48 units");startedAt=x.started_at||startedAt;}else{const rows=parseCSV(rd.result),head=rows.shift()||[],pos=Object.fromEntries(head.map((x,i)=>[x,i])),get=(r,k)=>r[pos[k]]||"";if(pos.annotator!==undefined&&rows[0]&&get(rows[0],"annotator")!==annotator)throw Error("annotator mismatch");const seen=new Set();rows.forEach(r=>{const no=Number(get(r,"unit_no")),hash=get(r,"audit_key_hash"),i=units.findIndex(u=>u.unit_no===no&&u.audit_key_hash===hash);if(i<0)throw Error("unit key mismatch");if(seen.has(no))throw Error("duplicate unit_no");seen.add(no);answers[i]=Object.assign(blank(),{L1:get(r,"L1"),L2:get(r,"L2"),L3:get(r,"L3"),unsure:get(r,"unsure").toLowerCase()==="yes",note:get(r,"note"),seconds_on_unit:Number(get(r,"seconds_on_unit"))||0});});if(seen.size!==units.length)throw Error("expected exactly 48 units");}save();render();alert("Imported / 已导入");}catch(e){alert("Import failed: "+e.message);}};rd.readAsText(file);}
function renderPractice(){$("practiceMount").innerHTML=practiceUnits.map((u,i)=>{const a=practiceAnswers[i],checked=practiceChecked[i];let h="<article class='card'><h3>Practice "+u.no+"</h3><h4>Problem / 题目</h4><div class='problem'>"+block(u.problem)+"</div><h4>Reference steps / 参考步骤</h4>"+u.steps.map((t,j)=>"<div class='step'>"+(j+1)+". "+block(t)+"</div>").join("")+"<div class='final'><strong>Correct final / 正确答案:</strong> "+block(u.final)+"</div><h4>Messages / 消息</h4>";u.messages.forEach(m=>h+="<div class='msg "+m.role.toLowerCase()+"'><div class='msg-head'>"+(m.role==='AI'?"AI reply "+m.reply:"Student")+"</div>"+block(m.text)+"</div>");h+="<div class='field'><strong>L1</strong><br><select data-p='"+i+"' data-k='L1'><option value=''>Choose / 选择</option><option value='none'>none</option><option value='1'>1</option><option value='2'>2</option><option value='3'>3</option></select></div><div class='field'><strong>L2</strong><br>";['AI','Student','Neither'].forEach(v=>h+="<label><input type='radio' name='pL2"+i+"' data-p='"+i+"' data-k='L2' value='"+v+"'>"+v+"</label>");h+="</div><div class='field'><strong>L3</strong><br>";['yes','no'].forEach(v=>h+="<label><input type='radio' name='pL3"+i+"' data-p='"+i+"' data-k='L3' value='"+v+"'>"+v+"</label>");h+="</div><button class='checkPractice' data-i='"+i+"'>"+(checked?"Checked / 已检查":"Check answer / 检查答案")+"</button>"+(checked?"<div class='practice-result'><strong>Correct / 正确：</strong>L1="+u.answer.L1+", L2="+u.answer.L2+", L3="+u.answer.L3+".<br>"+u.reason+"</div>":"")+"</article>";return h;}).join("");practiceUnits.forEach((u,i)=>{const a=practiceAnswers[i];const s=document.querySelector("select[data-p='"+i+"']");if(s)s.value=a.L1;document.querySelectorAll("input[data-p='"+i+"']").forEach(x=>{if(x.type==='radio')x.checked=x.value===a[x.dataset.k];x.onchange=()=>{a[x.dataset.k]=x.value;};});});document.querySelectorAll('.checkPractice').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const i=Number(b.dataset.i),a=practiceAnswers[i];if(!a.L1||!a.L2||!a.L3){alert("Answer all three labels first. / 请先回答三个标签。");return;}practiceChecked[i]=true;renderPractice();$("beginUnits").disabled=!practiceChecked.every(Boolean);});}
function startSession(name,autoSelftest=false){annotator=String(name).trim();if(!annotator){$("startError").textContent="Annotator name is required. / 必须填写标注者姓名。";$("startError").classList.remove("hidden");return;}$("startScreen").classList.add("hidden");$("appHeader").classList.remove("hidden");$("privacyNotice").classList.remove("hidden");$("practicePanel").classList.remove("hidden");$("annotatorDisplay").textContent=annotator;load();renderPractice();if(autoSelftest){practiceChecked=practiceUnits.map(()=>true);practiceDone=true;answers=units.map((u,i)=>({L1:i%3===0?"none":String((i%Math.max(1,u.n_replies))+1),L2:i%2?"Student":"AI",L3:i%2?"no":"yes",unsure:false,note:"selftest",seconds_on_unit:1}));$("practicePanel").classList.add("hidden");$("annotationPanel").classList.remove("hidden");render();setTimeout(()=>exportJSON(true),100);}}
$("startBtn").onclick=()=>startSession($("annotatorName").value);$("annotatorName").onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')startSession($("annotatorName").value);};$("beginUnits").onclick=()=>{practiceDone=true;$("practicePanel").classList.add("hidden");$("annotationPanel").classList.remove("hidden");render();};$("prev").onclick=()=>{if(index>0){recordTime();index--;save();render();window.scrollTo(0,0);}};$("next").onclick=()=>{if(index<units.length-1){recordTime();index++;save();render();window.scrollTo(0,0);}};$("exportJson").onclick=()=>exportJSON(false);$("exportCsv").onclick=exportCSV;$("importBtn").onclick=()=>$("importFile").click();$("importFile").onchange=e=>{if(e.target.files[0])importFile(e.target.files[0]);};$("glossary").innerHTML=glossary.map(g=>"<tr><td>"+esc(g.word)+"</td><td>"+esc(g.meaning)+"</td><td>"+g.count+"</td></tr>").join("");
document.addEventListener("change",e=>{if(e.target.matches("select[data-p]"))practiceAnswers[Number(e.target.dataset.p)].L1=e.target.value;});
if(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("selftest")==="1")startSession("selftest",true);
</script></body></html>
